<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="my">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>မောင်စိုးမိုးထိုက် & မမြတ်မိုးအိမ် | မင်္ဂလာဖိတ်စာ</title>
    
    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    
    <!-- Google Fonts: Myanmar & Elegant Serif/Script -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Great+Vibes&family=Noto+Sans+Myanmar:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Noto+Serif+Myanmar:wght@400;600;700&family=Padauk:wght@400;700&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,500;0,700;1,500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <!-- Font Awesome for Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">

    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-ivory: #fcf9f2;
            --bg-cream: #f5efe2;
            --rose-gold: #b77b76;
            --crimson-seal: #8f2d36;
            --gold-accent: #c59b47;
            --sage-accent: #5d6e53;
            --text-dark: #332927;
            --text-muted: #70605c;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Noto Sans Myanmar', 'Padauk', sans-serif;
            background-color: #e8e0d3;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
        }

        .font-serif-mm {
            font-family: 'Noto Serif Myanmar', 'Padauk', serif;
        }

        .font-script {
            font-family: 'Great Vibes', cursive;
        }

        .font-playfair {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
        }

        /* Romantic Paper Texture */
        .paper-texture {
            background-color: var(--bg-ivory);
            background-image: 
                radial-gradient(rgba(197, 155, 71, 0.06) 1px, transparent 0),
                radial-gradient(rgba(183, 123, 118, 0.05) 1px, transparent 0);
            background-size: 26px 26px;
            background-position: 0 0, 13px 13px;
        }

        /* Realistic Crimson & Gold Wax Seal */
        .wax-seal {
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%, #b53f49 0%, #8f2d36 55%, #5c1920 100%);
            box-shadow: 
                0 12px 28px rgba(92, 25, 32, 0.42),
                inset 0 2px 6px rgba(255, 225, 190, 0.45),
                inset 0 -4px 10px rgba(45, 10, 14, 0.65);
            position: relative;
            transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
        }

        .wax-seal::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            inset: 7px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 2px solid rgba(235, 196, 115, 0.45);
            box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.35), 0 1px 1px rgba(255,235,190,0.3);
        }

        .wax-seal:hover {
            transform: scale(1.06);
        }

        .wax-seal:active {
            transform: scale(0.95);
        }

        /* Envelope Doors Animation */
        .envelope-door-left, .envelope-door-right {
            transition: transform 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.65, 0, 0.35, 1);
        }

        .envelope-opened .envelope-door-left {
            transform: translateX(-105%);
        }

        .envelope-opened .envelope-door-right {
            transform: translateX(105%);
        }

        .envelope-opened .seal-container {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: scale(1.25);
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        @keyframes crackFlash {
            0% { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.85); }
            50% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.05); }
            100% { opacity: 0; transform: scale(1.1); }
        }
        .cracking .crack-svg {
            animation: crackFlash 0.5s ease-out forwards;
        }

        /* Floating Petals */
        .petal {
            position: fixed;
            top: -10%;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 40;
            opacity: 0.7;
            animation: fall linear infinite;
        }

        @keyframes fall {
            0% {
                transform: translateY(-10vh) rotate(0deg) translateX(0px);
                opacity: 0;
            }
            15% { opacity: 0.75; }
            85% { opacity: 0.75; }
            100% {
                transform: translateY(110vh) rotate(360deg) translateX(35px);
                opacity: 0;
            }
        }

        /* Arch Photo Frame */
        .arch-frame {
            border-radius: 9999px 9999px 14px 14px;
        }

        @keyframes floatSlow {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-6px); }
        }
        .animate-float {
            animation: floatSlow 3s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="flex justify-center min-h-screen">

